    {
      "path": [
        "options"
      ],
      "source": "\r\n  helmet:\r\n    name: '&cNo Helmet'\r\n    posx: 2\r\n    posy: 1\r\n    material: LEATHER_HELMET\r\n    flags: [ ALL ]\r\n  chestplate:\r\n    name: '&cNo Chestplate'\r\n    posx: 3\r\n    posy: 1\r\n    material: LEATHER_CHESTPLATE\r\n    flags: [ ALL ]\r\n  leggings:\r\n    name: '&cNo Leggings'\r\n    posx: 4\r\n    posy: 1\r\n    material: LEATHER_LEGGINGS\r\n    flags: [ ALL ]\r\n  boots:\r\n    name: '&cNo Boots'\r\n    posx: 5\r\n    posy: 1\r\n    material: LEATHER_BOOTS\r\n    flags: [ ALL ]\r\n  offhand:\r\n    name: '&cNo item in offhand'\r\n    posx: 7\r\n    posy: 1\r\n    material: WOODEN_HOE\r\n    flags: [ ALL ]\r\n  mainhand:\r\n    name: '&cNo item in main hand'\r\n    posx: 8\r\n    posy: 1\r\n    material: WOODEN_SWORD\r\n    flags: [ ALL ]\r\n  offhand-indicator:\r\n    name: '&cAbove is showing the offhand'\r\n    posx: 7\r\n    posy: 2\r\n    material: RED_STAINED_GLASS_PANE\r\n  mainhand-indicator:\r\n    name: '&cAbove is showing the main hand in slot{$colon} &e%held_slot%'\r\n    posx: 8\r\n    posy: 2\r\n    material: RED_STAINED_GLASS_PANE\r\n  separators:\r\n    name: ''\r\n    slots: [ 0, 5, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 17 ]\r\n    material: BLACK_STAINED_GLASS_PANE",
      "comments": [
        "It's important to not change the config entry names of armors and hands.",
        "These slots will be replaced if the player has the item."
